{"id":"force_ment","lemma":"forcément","pos":"adv","rank":1519,"glosses":["inevitably","necessarily"],"ipa":"/fɔʁ.se.mɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/af/Fr-Paris--forc%C3%A9ment.ogg/Fr-Paris--forc%C3%A9ment.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ce sera forcément un problème.","en":"That's bound to be a problem.","words":[{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"problem"}]},{"text":"Tes parents le savent forcément.","en":"Your parents ought to know it.","words":[{"g":"your"},{"g":"relative","l":"parent"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"to know","l":"savoir"},null]},{"text":"Ce travail n'est pas forcément facile.","en":"This work is not necessarily easy.","words":[{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"work"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"easy, simple"}]},{"text":"Les choses vont forcément s'améliorer.","en":"Things are bound to get better.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"thing","l":"chose"},{"g":"to go","l":"aller"},null,{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"to improve"}]},{"text":"On fait forcément des erreurs de temps en temps.","en":"We're bound to make mistakes from time to time.","words":[{"g":"we / one"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},null,{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"error","l":"erreur"},null,null,null,null],"phrases":[[5,9,"from time to time"]]}]}